Package: gstreamer1.0-plugins-vidc
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: QTI vidc plugin for GStreamer
 GStreamer hardware decoder and encoder plugins based on vidc APIs.
 Provides H.264, H.265, MPEG-2, VP9 and AV1 (av1-dec=enabled) decoders,
 H.264 and H.265 encoders, and the vidcwrapper shared library.
 Built with DMA buffer heap support (usedmaheap=true).
